                                                "sense_id": "8860fed6-3e1c-3537-af76-bb05f2f8b58c",
                                                "text": "I am withal persuaded that it may prove much more easy in the assay than it now seems at distance."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a32a1619-6302-3c64-8f20-a2d4a839c686",
                                        "entry_id": "9e2b7daf-f271-3208-8c38-2f96fc39bd1a",
